    <title>0.153.4</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;Bug Fixes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed Astra’s visibility in the bundled model picker and made it the bundled default when no model is explicitly configured. (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5353618742&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/42874&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openai/codex/pull/42874/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/42874&quot;&gt;#42874&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Updated Astra’s guidance to use asynchronous questions only when the tool is available in the session. (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5353787347&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/42878&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openai/codex/pull/42878/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/42878&quot;&gt;#42878&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Changelog&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Full Changelog: &lt;a class=&quot;commit-link&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/compare/rust-v0.153.3...rust-v0.153.4&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;rust-v0.153.3...rust-v0.153.4&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5353618742&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/42874&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openai/codex/pull/42874/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/42874&quot;&gt;#42874&lt;/a&gt; [0.153 hotfix] Show Astra in bundled model picker &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/rhan-oai/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/rhan-oai&quot;&gt;@rhan-oai&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5353787347&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/42878&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openai/codex/pull/42878/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/42878&quot;&gt;#42878&lt;/a&gt; [0.153 hotfix] Qualify Astra async-question guidance by tool availability &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/rhan-oai/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/rhan-oai&quot;&gt;@rhan-oai&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
