    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;New Features&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added GPT-6-Astra to the Amazon Bedrock model picker for Mantle and Runtime global/US routes. (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5351107797&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/42805&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openai/codex/pull/42805/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/42805&quot;&gt;#42805&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Bug Fixes&lt;/h2&gt;
