&lt;li&gt;Corrected GPT-6-Astra’s guidance for asynchronous clarification questions to use the supported tool and recognize that it accepts text only. (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5351301559&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/issues/42809&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openai/codex/pull/42809/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openai/codex/pull/42809&quot;&gt;#42809&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
